{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t港鐵表示，由於香港大學站附近有信號設備故障，列車行經該路段需要慢駛，來往堅尼地城站至柴灣站的整體行車時間預計需要額外 5至 8分鐘。港鐵人員正在處理。<br/>\n<br/>\n港鐵呼籲乘客為行程預留充裕時間。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：譚佩貞\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T00:43:54.840356+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T00:23:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T02:37:34.886099+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T00:37:30.771618+00:00","content_hash":"472117aeae93999d9a425098c2fa63f2d6d768b36485ca532c4e203ac680e7a4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}